# .cursorrules

This project follows the rules defined in CLAUDE.md. Read it before 
generating any code.

Key non-negotiables (see CLAUDE.md for full context):
- Constructor injection only, never field injection
- Business logic in Service layer, never in Controller
- DTOs for all API input/output, never expose JPA entities
- java.time only, never legacy Date/Calendar
- No deprecated APIs (WebSecurityConfigurerAdapter, etc.)

